https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b0ecc3d5-85ad-48fa-bc47-988107507e6c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b0ecc3d5-85ad-48fa-bc47-988107507e6c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/38px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/50px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ulder Ravengard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Ulder Ravengard</a> on completion of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Grand_Duke\" title=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Grand_Duke\" title=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\">Rescue the Grand Duke</a> / <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_Duke\" title=\"The Grand Duke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Grand Duke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_Duke\" title=\"The Grand Duke\">The Grand Duke</a>, with<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> as a camp follower or party member, but only if the Duke survives the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a></li>\n<li>Given by or looted from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cordula_Eltan\" title=\"Cordula Eltan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png/25px-Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png/38px-Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png/50px-Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cordula Eltan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png/25px-Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Portrait_Cordula_Eltan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cordula_Eltan\" title=\"Cordula Eltan\">Cordula Eltan</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Florrick\" title=\"Florrick\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/25px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/38px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/50px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counsellor Florrick\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/25px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Florrick\" title=\"Florrick\">Counsellor Florrick</a>, both of whom can be met in the streets of the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><i>Baldur's Gate - great Balduran's berth.<br>O <a href=\"/wiki/Balduran\" title=\"Balduran\">Balduran</a>, founder due veneration,<br>His guardian dragon <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>, tremendous in worth.<br>A saviour below, our eternal elation.<br>To <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrmway\" title=\"Wyrmway\">Wyrmway</a> 'neath prison's deepest level.<br>To be found by not a soul nor devil.</i>\n</p><p><br>\n[NOTE: Entrance in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Rock_Prison\" title=\"Wyrm's Rock Prison\">Wyrm's Rock Prison</a>? - U.R.]\n</p><p><br>\n<i>With a lightning shock, a true hero's spark flickers,<br>The torches alight!<br>And wyrm's eyes shall awake aglitter.</i>\n</p><p><br>\n[NOTE: Something about sparks and torches. Use lightning skills? - U.R.]\n</p><p><br>\n<i>It's trials, no common adventurer may exceed,<br>When each day sends forth new ones to their fates:<br>But one great hero, by the founder's will decreed,<br>Shall, only once, grand our age the Heart of the Gate!</i>\n</p><p><br>\n[Note: Only a great hero can pass the trials and awaken Ansur - U.R.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Contains instructions relating to the next steps of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Blade_of_Frontiers\" title=\"The Blade of Frontiers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Blade of Frontiers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Blade_of_Frontiers\" title=\"The Blade of Frontiers\">The Blade of Frontiers</a></li>\n<li>If the party persuade Cordula Eltan or Florrick not to attack, they give the book to Wyll. It is currently unclear which conditions must be met for them to spawn and start the Ansur quest this way instead of through Ravengard. Since telling them Ravengard is alive is a persuasion check and not a deception one, the death of Ravengard seems to be not one of the conditions.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195147\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3156/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43632/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15454/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 6/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1208734/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.661      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   58.661      1 -total\n 62.04%   36.394     14 Template:Icon_text\n 53.46%   31.359     31 Template:Trim\n 35.23%   20.668      9 Template:Icon_link\n 31.36%   18.395      5 Template:CharLink\n 27.80%   16.307      1 Template:PageSeo\n 27.71%   16.254      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 20.46%   12.002     14 Template:Ifempty\n 16.90%    9.911      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17636-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195147 and revision id 361630. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}